Package: hitori
Version: @DEB_HITORI_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://wiki.gnome.org/Apps/Hitori
Depends: libglib2.0-0, libgtk-3-0, libcairo2
Description: Hitori (GNOME logic puzzle)
 Hitori is a small GNOME puzzle game: cross out squares until no number is
 repeated in any row or column, with no two crossed squares adjacent and the
 uncrossed squares all connected. Pure C/GTK3. Runs as a plain X11 client.
